B.bLc=s(["GymDesk itilize kat QR san non ni foto. Chak kat gen yon nimewo epi yon k\xf2d PIN manm lan antre l\xe8 l rive.","GymDesk utilise des cartes QR anonymes. Chaque carte porte un num\xe9ro et le membre saisit son code PIN \xe0 l\u2019entr\xe9e.","GymDesk uses anonymous QR badges. Each card carries a number and the member enters their PIN at the door."],t.s)
