B.bPn=s(["Kreye sal ou a, resevwa 10 kat es\xe8, envite ekip ou. Apre 7 jou an, senpman peye pou kontinye.","Cr\xe9ez votre salle, recevez 10 cartes d\u2019essai, invitez votre \xe9quipe. Apr\xe8s 7 jours, payez simplement pour continuer.","Create your gym, get 10 trial badges, invite your team. After 7 days, simply pay to continue."],t.s)
